1
00:00:03,403 --> 00:00:04,993
(Leonard:)The interface is pretty simple.

2
00:00:05,205 --> 00:00:09,035
You put your horizontal X-coordinate here,
vertical Y-coordinate here.

3
00:00:09,275 --> 00:00:11,535
(Leonard:)When you're happy with those,
press this button.

4
00:00:11,778 --> 00:00:13,078
(Penny:)Got it.

5
00:00:17,283 --> 00:00:20,913
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you'll never guess
who I just found online. Hey.

6
00:00:22,789 --> 00:00:25,659
- Nice shot.
- Eh, his giant head did most of the work.

7
00:00:27,427 --> 00:00:30,917
(Sheldon:)Very mature.
You're lucky I'm out of Silly String.

8
00:00:31,598 --> 00:00:35,228
(Sheldon:)As I was saying, Leonard,
you'll never guess who I just found online.

9
00:00:35,435 --> 00:00:37,735
(Sheldon:)- Professor Proton.
- You're kidding.

10
00:00:37,937 --> 00:00:39,907
(Leonard:)- He's still alive?
- Yes.

11
00:00:40,106 --> 00:00:43,906
- Who's Professor Proton?
- He was the host of this great... Hey.

12
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:47,100
Yes. Sorry, tell me about Professor Proton.

13
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:51,037
Professor Proton hosted my favorite
science show when I was a child.

14
00:00:51,251 --> 00:00:52,741
(Sheldon:)I never missed an episode.

15
00:00:52,952 --> 00:00:56,012
(Sheldon:)He demonstrated scientific principles
using everyday objects.

16
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:57,452
(Leonard:)It was pretty cool.

17
00:00:57,624 --> 00:01:00,924
Aw. It's so cute when you use
the word "cool" wrong.

18
00:01:01,928 --> 00:01:04,458
Like when kids say "pasghetti."

19
00:01:05,465 --> 00:01:07,435
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear Lord. Leonard, look.

20
00:01:07,634 --> 00:01:10,124
(Sheldon:)He's still available for parties and events.

21
00:01:10,370 --> 00:01:13,340
(Sheldon:)- We should hire him.
- Hire him to do what?

22
00:01:13,540 --> 00:01:17,140
(Sheldon:)Whatever we want.
Hang out, do experiments...

23
00:01:17,377 --> 00:01:20,647
(Sheldon:)...make him take 12 pictures with us
so we can make a calendar.

24
00:01:21,214 --> 00:01:25,154
It would be awesome to hang out with him.
I just used "awesome" wrong, didn't I?

25
00:01:26,853 --> 00:01:28,943
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm e-mailing him right now.

26
00:01:29,155 --> 00:01:31,745
- Do you remember his old theme song?
- Of course I do.

27
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:34,225
(Together:)Grab your goggles, put your lab coat on

28
00:01:34,394 --> 00:01:39,024
(Together:)Here he comes, Professor Proton

